  "instance_name": "incompatibility_with_western_values",
  "label": "Incompatibility with Western Values",
  "description": "The meme references the stereotype that religious practices, particularly those associated with Islam, are incompatible with Western values. This stereotype is used to justify the violent imagery and to frame the religion as being under attack, even though the religion itself is peaceful. The meme uses this stereotype to provoke strong emotional reactions and to delegitimize criticism of the religion by equating it with violence.",
